tests/golden/check/fixedbugs-250-an-escape-in-a-header-name-is-told-once-by-the-head.hero:9:8: error[escape_in_header_name]: this header's name holds `\`, which C leaves undefined in a header's name (C11 6.4.7) and clang does not read alike on every platform, so the name does not say one file on every machine: write `/` between directories, or rename the header without it
